{% block user %}Computed quality-control metrics for {{ n_obs }} cells and {{ n_vars }} genes, including total counts, number of detected genes, and mitochondrial content per cell (prefix: "{{ params.get('mt_prefix', 'MT-') }}").{% endblock %}

{% block methods %}Quality-control metrics were calculated for each cell and gene using sc.pp.calculate_qc_metrics from Scanpy [{{ citation_key if citation_key is defined else 'scanpy_calculate_qc_metrics' }}]. Per-cell metrics computed include total UMI counts (total_counts), number of genes detected (n_genes_by_counts), and percentage of counts attributable to mitochondrial genes (pct_counts_mt), with mitochondrial genes identified by the prefix "{{ params.get('mt_prefix', 'MT-') }}". Per-gene metrics include mean counts across cells (mean_counts) and the number of cells in which each gene is detected (n_cells_by_counts). These metrics were used to assess data quality and inform downstream filtering thresholds.{% endblock %}
